===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|Falkland Island||attributive}}

===Etymology===
Name taken from the [[Falkland Sound]], which was named for {{w|Viscount Falkland}} by [[w:John Strong (mariner)|John Strong]], who landed on the islands in 1690.

